title: "PAI Papers: Lab Report Series on Local and Hierarchical Coding Agents"
abstract: >-
  Measured experiments running agentic coding workers on local open-weight models on one
  Apple-silicon workstation, against cloud yardsticks, and in a hierarchy where a cloud
  planner directs local implementing workers.
